9.0 References
This research was primarily based on practical experimentation conducted within a controlled virtual laboratory environment, supported by the researcher's extensive professional experience in IT infrastructure, networking, systems engineering and cybersecurity.
The laboratory architecture, configuration decisions, troubleshooting activities, experimental procedures and interpretation of results were principally informed by practical experience rather than being directly reproduced from published research.
